						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#829">The rebuild is complete!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							With 21 active members we have achieved our Guild recovery, I must thank you all for being part of it, especially Wyrven, the FOTW and our old Knights Aailin and Drek. <br />
<br />
Our leader and creator Safron has not yet returned, she recovered from her coma and is in good health. Yet we still wait, resolute with faith and hope. This mission is what makes KOTEW Knights &quot;unique&quot;, it is both unselfish and honourable.<br />
<br />
Fallguy<br />
<br />
OUR HOMEPAGE http://kuboko.pwp.blueyonder.co.uk/
						</td>
