				<td width="100%">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#828">Guild Charter (to be agreed)</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							KOTEW Knights do not need specific rules on their behaviour, for we shall allways act with honour and compassion.<br />
<br />
We are able to act independantly, without constant help and support. That does not imply we do not ask for help, it means that we do not expect to be &quot;nursed&quot;.<br />
<br />
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<br />
<br />
Our guild is a family that values three main virtues:<br />
<br />
1. FUN - Not much point in being in a guild if its not fun :)<br />
<br />
2. LOYALTY - We support our peers and our guild. &quot;Once a KOTEW Knight allways a Knight&quot; members who leave do so with our blessing and will allways be welcomed home...we respect freedom of choice. This loyalty does not apply to banned members.<br />
<br />
3. RESPECT - we will respect others and their freedom of choice. We must balance the fun with respect and know where to &quot;draw the line.&quot;<br />
<br />
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<br />
<br />
In KOTEW expect:<br />
<br />
Daft, mad and sometimes immature witty behaviour, friendly insults, chaotic meetings (with deaths by dualling) and the occasional guild raid. <br />
<br />
Expect to make some worthwhile friends.<br />
<br />
DO NOT EXPECT:<br />
<br />
Constant help and advice, constant guild raids. Constant companionship for we are a big guild in character but not in numbers. Roleplaying is up to the individual member.<br />
<br />
Dont ask what this guild can do for you? ask what you can do for it!<br />
   <br />
<br />
<br />
             Fallguy Fireblade<br />
             47th season Ranger<br />
    Captain Knights of the Ebon Wolf<br />
<br />
<br />
OUR HOMEPAGE http://kuboko.pwp.blueyonder.co.uk/
